      "card_ids": ["C07"],
      "claim": "The closest analogue C07 showed poor brain penetration (SUV 15%) attributed to reduced lipophilicity; this is contradictory, but the query's added fluorine, extra methylene, and altered fused core increase lipophilicity, limiting direct transfer of this failure.",
      "evidence_role": "contradictory"
